V1 Prompt: You are a product marketing manager, based on the course information below, the audience personas you developed, and the competitor matrix you built for the Double Degree Bachelor of Computer Science / Master of Data Science, write a product brief bringing everything together into a 3 page word document that can be presented to the University partner for feedback.
Course info is in appendix 
