Strategic implications

Lead with online delivery and the four-year double qualification because this combination creates the clearest market difference.

Use the ATAR 75 threshold and mathematics settings to reduce perceived barriers, while explaining the preparation and support available.

Prove industry involvement with concrete curriculum examples, certification pathways and confirmed student opportunities.

Treat responsible innovation as a curriculum feature rather than a general brand statement by linking it to units, assessments and research.

Test the claim that the course is the only offering of its kind in New South Wales before using it publicly.

Partner feedback required

